  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get all products",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const response = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test(`Products returned: ${response.products.length}`, function () {",
              "    pm.expect(response.products.length).to.eql(response.total);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Verify the status code\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Verify the response time is below 1000ms\", function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Validate the product structure\", function () {",
              "    const product = response.products[0];",
              "",
              "    pm.expect(product).to.have.property(\"id\");",
              "    pm.expect(product).to.have.property(\"title\");",
              "    pm.expect(product).to.have.property(\"price\");",
              "    pm.expect(product).to.have.property(\"category\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://dummyjson.com/products?limit=0",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "dummyjson",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "products"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "0"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "\\->Request for all products\n\n\\->Test performed:\n\n\\*Retrieved all available products by removing the default pagination limit  \n\\*Verified the total product count\n\n\\*Validated the product response structure  \n\\*Verified the response time was below 1000 ms\n\n\\->Get single products\n\nTest performed :  \n\\*Retrieved a single product  \n\\*verified the single product is same as the request got  \n\\*Verified the single product structure\n\n\\->Search product\n\nTest performed\n\n\\*Retrieved a single specific product\n\n\\*Verified the single specific product structure\n\n\\->Nagative testing products\n\nTest performed\n\n\\*verified the error massages\n\n\\*verifed the error responsed code\n\n\\->Create new product\n\nTest performed:\n\n\\*Verfied the Product ID generated\n\n\\*Verifed the created Title matches what we sent\n\n\\*Verifed the Price matches the created product\n\n\\*Veriifed the Response structure of the Created product"
      },
      "response": []
